The {{nihongo|'''Masumizu clan'''|升水氏|Masumizu-shi}} was a [[Nakamian clan|Nakamian samurai clan]]. Masumizu clan is the branch of Kawaei clan formed with the imperial aliance with [[Chahar Khanate]] by [[Kawaei Kaiyo]], the younger sister of Kawaei clan head at that time, [[Kawaei Yoshifumi]]. Masumizu clan later evolved as Sanese-Mongol clan ruled over the part of [[Kinugasa provinces]] as the Kawaei clan solidify their power as the defacto shogun of [[Nakamizu|Southern Court]] at [[Katajima|Inaba]]. Masumizu clan continue to rule part of [[Chahar Khanate]] until [[Great Adonia War]].